  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An integrated response to emergency health and nutrition needs in the targeted priority districts in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide health and nutrition assistance to people affected by food insecurity in Al Hodeida, Hajjah and Taiz governorates. This WHO project provides humanitarian assistance to 126,782 people, including 31,685 women, 32,975 men, 62,122 children, and including 9,748 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
